			<item>
				<title>Graphviz</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cpp_notes/posts/tools/graphviz/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cpp_notes/posts/tools/graphviz/</guid>
				<description>&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://graphviz.org/documentation/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;Graphviz&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;vscode&lt;/code&gt;插件： &lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=qiu.graphviz-language-support-and-preivew&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;Graphviz(dot) language supported and preview&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;dot语法&#34;&gt;Dot语法&lt;a href=&#34;#dot%e8%af%ad%e6%b3%95&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;文档：&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://graphviz.org/doc/info/lang.html&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;DOT Language&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;基本规则&#34;&gt;基本规则&lt;a href=&#34;#%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e8%a7%84%e5%88%99&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;首先需要定义一张画布，然后在画布中添加一系列的指令（&lt;code&gt;statement&lt;/code&gt;）语句， 即&lt;code&gt;stmt_list&lt;/code&gt;，且每一条语句可以以 &lt;code&gt;;&lt;/code&gt; 或者 &lt;code&gt;,&lt;/code&gt; 进行区分。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
